# The build context is the repository root, so bank can build against
# packages/go. BuildKit reads this file instead of the root
# .dockerignore. Allowlist: a stray archive or blob store would otherwise be
# baked into an image layer.
*
!apps/bank
!packages/go/extract
!packages/go/pgschema
apps/bank/.claude
apps/bank/.env
apps/bank/bank
apps/bank/**/*.log

# Local data directories, if anyone points BANK_DATA_DIR at the repo.
apps/bank/.bankdata
apps/bank/blobs/
apps/bank/archive/
apps/bank/inbox/

# IMAP collector config, certificates and its queue of decrypted mail.
apps/bank/imap.json
apps/bank/config.json
apps/bank/**/*.pem
apps/bank/state/
apps/bank/imap-state/
